"Plural-Forms: nplurals=2; plural=(n != 1);\n"

msgctxt "240"
msgid ""
"Several years passed. I ran into Kinoshita-san and we\r\n"
"eventually got married."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "252"
msgid ""
"I started selling things as a hobby, and it soon turned into\r\n"
"a business. Before I knew it, it grew into a large company."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "264"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "276"
msgid ""
"It's been six years since that day, and my life's been\r\n"
"going so well. I can't believe the truth came out now,\r\n"
"of all times..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "288"
msgid "Yuko-san..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "300"
msgid ""
"Did you ever think what it felt like for Akechi-san\r\n"
"to have to bear these false charges?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "312"
msgid ""
"What it felt like to be knocked down to rock bottom and have\r\n"
"his freedom stolen from him these past six years?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "324"
msgid ""
"And think what would've happened if we hadn't revealed the\r\n"
"truth just now. How many more years would he have suffered?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "336"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "348"
msgid ""
"Only the person who took Akechi-san's freedom away can\r\n"
"give it back. You need to turn yourself in."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "360"
msgid "Testify in front of a court and pay for your crimes."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "372"
msgid "Can I escort you to the station?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "384"
msgid "Yes..."
msgstr "Sì..."

msgctxt "396"
msgid "Yuko!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "408"
msgid "I'll be right here waiting for you when you get back!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "420"
msgid "Masaru..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "432"
msgid "...Thank you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "540"
msgid "That day was his⑬Oda-san's⑬birthday."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "552"
msgid ""
"I wanted to surprise him, so I grabbed his present\r\n"
"and went to the café."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "576"
msgid ""
"But it was already closed. So I came in through the back\r\n"
"door and headed for the locker room."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "600"
msgid ""
"But when I got there, I saw him cheating on me with some\r\n"
"other woman...!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "624"
msgid ""
"I hid for a while, trying to calm down. I tried desperately\r\n"
"to understand what I'd just seen..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "648"
msgid "That's when Akechi-san showed up."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "672"
msgid ""
"When Akechi-san peeked into the locker room and saw\r\n"
"Usami-san cheating on him with Oda-san, he dropped the\r\n"
"ashtray and grabbed Oda-san."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "696"
msgid ""
"But as I heard them start yelling, I saw Usami-san rush out\r\n"
"of the locker room and out the back door of the café."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "720"
msgid "Then Akechi-san ran out of the building after her."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "744"
msgid ""
"I went into the locker room once Usami-san and\r\n"
"Akechi-san had left."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "756"
msgid ""
"Oda-san looked surprised to see me at first, but then he\r\n"
"realized I knew he'd been cheating, and he started talking\r\n"
"about breaking up with me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "768"
msgid "He said, \"I want to be with Usami. It's over.\""
msgstr ""

msgctxt "780"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "804"
msgid "When I heard those words... I saw red."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "816"
msgid ""
"The next thing I knew, I'd hit Oda-san with the ashtray\r\n"
"Akechi-san had dropped on the floor."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "840"
msgid ""
"The rest is just as Kiryu-san says. I changed into a uniform\r\n"
"I found in one of the lockers and waited by the back door\r\n"
"for somebody to come."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "852"
msgid ""
"Someone came in from the front, so I hid my face and ran\r\n"
"out the back door."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "876"
msgid ""
"I figured nobody would suspect me since I didn't have\r\n"
"anything to do with the café anymore."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "936"
msgid "Will you give a statement that Yuichi Akechi is innocent?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "948"
msgid "Yes... Akechi-san had nothing to do with the murder."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "960"
msgid "Yuko, how could you have done such a thing...?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "972"
msgid "Was it really just because Oda-san was cheating?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "984"
msgid ""
"Of course that's what it was about! He said he was going to\r\n"
"marry me...!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "996"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1044"
msgid "Her?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1056"
msgid "Are you serious!?"
msgstr "Dici sul serio!?"

msgctxt "1068"
msgid "I can't believe it!"
msgstr "Non ci posso credere!"

msgctxt "1080"
msgid "What!?"
msgstr "Cosa!?"

msgctxt "1092"
msgid "Yuko... killed Oda-san...?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1104"
msgid "An interesting theory... But why would I kill Oda-san?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1116"
msgid "I didn't have any reason to do anything like that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1128"
msgid ""
"Yeah. Yuichi Akechi's motive was Usami-san's relationship\r\n"
"with Oda-san."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1140"
msgid "Exactly how are Yuko-san and Oda-san connected?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1152"
msgid ""
"(I need something to prove Yuko and Oda knew each other\r\n"
"somehow...)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1176"
msgid ""
"Oda was dating somebody at the time of the murder.\r\n"
"Somebody who used to work as a waitress at Café Alps."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1188"
msgid "What!? Is that true?"
msgstr "Cosa? È vero!?"

msgctxt "1200"
msgid "Yeah. And her last name was Saitoh."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1212"
msgid "Saitoh? That's Yuko's maiden name!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1224"
msgid ""
"I hear you worked at this café until just before the time\r\n"
"of the murder."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1236"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1248"
msgid "Yuko-san and Oda-san were dating?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1260"
msgid "I didn't know that!"
msgstr "Non lo sapevo."

msgctxt "1272"
msgid "Yuko-san, is that true?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1284"
msgid "I don't have to answer that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1296"
msgid "Yuko..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1320"
msgid "(No, that doesn't prove anything.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1332"
msgid ""
"(I need something to prove Yuko and Oda knew each other\r\n"
"somehow...)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1356"
msgid ""
"If Oda-san was dating Yuko-san, then Usami-san wasn't\r\n"
"the only one cheating."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1368"
msgid "Oda was cheating, too!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1380"
msgid "And that means Yuko-san also had motive to kill Oda-san."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1392"
msgid ""
"So anyone with a motive is a killer? You haven't done anything but "
"hypothesize."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1404"
msgid ""
"Exactly. You've only talked about possibilities. Do you\r\n"
"have any conclusive evidence that she murdered him?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1416"
msgid ""
"(Conclusive evidence... like fingerprints...? If I only had\r\n"
"something with Yuko's fingerprints on it...)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1440"
msgid "This is the evidence."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1452"
msgid "Is that my business card?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1464"
msgid ""
"This business card has your fingerprints on it.\r\n"
"We should be able to compare the prints on this card to\r\n"
"the ones on the murder weapon."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1476"
msgid "......!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1488"
msgid "Give me that business card. Let's check it out right now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1560"
msgid "(No, that doesn't prove anything.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1572"
msgid ""
"(If I only had something with Yuko's fingerprints\r\n"
"on it...)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1596"
msgid ""
"We've finished analyzing the prints on the card. These are\r\n"
"Yuko Kinoshita's prints."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1620"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1632"
msgid "And these are the prints on the ashtray."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1656"
msgid "They're⑬"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1692"
msgid ""
"The prints on Yuko-san's business card are the same as\r\n"
"the ones on the murder weapon."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1704"
msgid "I don't believe it..."
msgstr "Non ci credo."

msgctxt "1728"
msgid "How do you explain that?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1740"
msgid ""
"Even if my prints are on that ashtray, so what? How\r\n"
"does that change anything?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1752"
msgid "What do you mean?"
msgstr "Cosa intendi?"

msgctxt "1764"
msgid ""
"I ate at Alps the day of the murder. I must've just touched\r\n"
"the ashtray while I was there."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1776"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1788"
msgid ""
"She's right. There's no crime in touching an ashtray. She\r\n"
"was just a customer."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1800"
msgid "(No, Yuko's lying. I should call her out on it.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1824"
msgid "No. You're lying."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1836"
msgid "What the hell are you talking about?"
msgstr "Ma che diavolo stai dicendo!?"

msgctxt "1848"
msgid ""
"There's no record of you coming to the café the day of the\r\n"
"murder. Right, Detective Maeda?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1860"
msgid "He's right."
msgstr "Ha ragione."

msgctxt "1872"
msgid ""
"We had Café Alps employees watch all the security tapes, and\r\n"
"they gave statements that no other café employees, former\r\n"
"or otherwise, visited the café that day."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1884"
msgid "Right, Kinoshita-san?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1896"
msgid "That's right."
msgstr "Esatto."

msgctxt "1920"
msgid ""
"I'd seen Yuko-san's face before, so I would've noticed\r\n"
"if she was on those tapes."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1932"
msgid "She definitely wasn't."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1956"
msgid "(No, that doesn't prove anything.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1968"
msgid "(I should have a statement that proves that Yuko is lying.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1992"
msgid ""
"Which means you didn't come to Café Alps on the day\r\n"
"of the murder as a customer."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2004"
msgid "So why were your fingerprints on the ashtray, then?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2016"
msgid ""
"Fine. Maybe it wasn't on the day of the murder. It might've\r\n"
"been the day before. It's not that big of an issue."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2028"
msgid "Nope, you had to have been here the day of the murder."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2040"
msgid "You weren't a customer... You were the real murderer."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2052"
msgid "Huh...?"
msgstr "Eh...?"

msgctxt "2064"
msgid ""
"The only people who could have prints on the murder weapon\r\n"
"were those who visited the day of the murder."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2076"
msgid "How did you come to that conclusion?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2088"
msgid ""
"(And now for the coup de grace... I just need something\r\n"
"to prove when the prints on the murder weapon were made.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2112"
msgid ""
"The ashtrays here are cleaned every day, but your prints\r\n"
"were still on the murder weapon."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2124"
msgid "That means you had to have been here the day of the murder."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2136"
msgid "But..."
msgstr "Ma..."

msgctxt "2148"
msgid ""
"The day of the murder, a customer dropped the ashtray,\r\n"
"chipping it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2160"
msgid ""
"Yuichi Akechi saw the chipped ashtray and, instead of\r\n"
"washing it, decided to throw it out."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2172"
msgid ""
"Since you couldn't have come to the café as a customer\r\n"
"that day, there's only one time you could've left your\r\n"
"prints on the ashtray."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2184"
msgid ""
"You did it after Akechi dropped the ashtray in the locker\r\n"
"room when he witnessed Usami cheating on him with Oda."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2196"
msgid ""
"Sometime after Akechi left and before Kinoshita came to\r\n"
"check up on him, you entered the locker room and murdered\r\n"
"Oda."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2208"
msgid "Then you put on Imagawa's uniform and went out the back."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2220"
msgid "Isn't that right?"
msgstr "Giusto?"

msgctxt "2232"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2244"
msgid "Yuko-san. Is what Kiryu-san says true?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2256"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2268"
msgid "It'll only get worse if you stay quiet."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2280"
msgid "Shut up! I told you I didn't do it!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2292"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2304"
msgid "I give up! Yuko, I'm putting an end to this."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2316"
msgid "What!?"
msgstr "Cosa!?"

msgctxt "2328"
msgid "Do you know something, Kinoshita-san?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2340"
msgid "I knew you came to the café that day, Yuko."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2352"
msgid "What...? How...?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2364"
msgid ""
"I could smell you. It was very faint, but I could smell your\r\n"
"perfume all around the crime scene..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2376"
msgid "No way..."
msgstr "Non è possibile..."

msgctxt "2388"
msgid "Why didn't you say this earlier?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2400"
msgid "I'd been in love with Yuko ever since we worked together."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2412"
msgid ""
"That's why I knew the scent of her perfume the minute\r\n"
"I smelled it..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2424"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2436"
msgid ""
"Some time after the murder, I happened to run into her\r\n"
"again. Eventually, we started dating."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2448"
msgid ""
"One day, I brought up the murder and her face went white.\r\n"
"She fell quiet, and avoided commenting on anything."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2460"
msgid ""
"That's when I was sure Yuko had been here the day of\r\n"
"the crime."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2472"
msgid "Well, I'll be..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2484"
msgid ""
"But I still didn't know exactly what that meant. Or, I\r\n"
"should say, I didn't want to know what that meant..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2496"
msgid ""
"When I found out Kiryu-san was looking into that old crime,\r\n"
"I decided to keep it all a secret."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2508"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2520"
msgid ""
"But now Yuichi Akechi has suffered six years for a crime he\r\n"
"didn't commit, all because I didn't say anything!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2532"
msgid ""
"It's all my fault! If I had just spoken up, none of this\r\n"
"would've happened."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2544"
msgid "Gee, Kinoshita-san..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2568"
msgid "(No, that doesn't prove anything.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2580"
msgid ""
"(I just need something to prove when the prints on the\r\n"
"murder weapon were made.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2616"
msgid ""
"Is that all you got? The police wouldn't have arrested\r\n"
"Akechi on just any ol' vague evidence, ya know."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2628"
msgid ""
"There was also something that proved the person\r\n"
"Kinoshita-san saw was, in fact, Akechi."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2640"
msgid "And what was that?"
msgstr "E cosa sarebbe?"

msgctxt "2652"
msgid ""
"The man Kinoshita-san saw leaving the scene of the crime was\r\n"
"wearing a Café Alps waiter's uniform."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2664"
msgid ""
"The only waiters employed by Café Alps at the time were\r\n"
"Kinoshita-san, Asai-san, Imagawa-san, and Akechi-san."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2676"
msgid ""
"The security tapes show Kinoshita-san and Asai-san out front\r\n"
"at the time of the murder."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2688"
msgid "We've also confirmed that Imagawa-san was at home."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2700"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2712"
msgid ""
"Therefore, by process of elimination, the only waiter\r\n"
"Kinoshita-san could have seen was Akechi."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2724"
msgid "Kiryu-san, is that true?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2736"
msgid ""
"No, it's absolutely possible that the person Kinoshita\r\n"
"saw was not Akechi. I have a statement to prove it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2748"
msgid "Well, then, why don't you share this statement with us?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2760"
msgid ""
"(I have a statement that proves the person seen leaving Café\r\n"
"Alps might not have been Akechi. I need to present that now.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2784"
msgid ""
"There was actually another crime committed at this café\r\n"
"the day of the murder six years ago."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2796"
msgid "Another crime? That's the first I've heard of it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2808"
msgid ""
"Imagawa's uniform disappeared from his locker in the\r\n"
"Café Alps locker room on that day."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2820"
msgid "Imagawa-kun's uniform?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2832"
msgid "Yes! My uniform disappeared from my locker."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2856"
msgid "(No, that doesn't prove anything.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2868"
msgid ""
"(I have a statement that proves the person seen leaving Café Alps\r\n"
"might not have been Akechi.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2892"
msgid ""
"Since you weren't present the day of the murder, when\r\n"
"did you notice it was missing?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2904"
msgid ""
"The day after Oda-san was murdered, I came to work.\r\n"
"The police were investigating, so I couldn't go in."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2916"
msgid ""
"But once the police left, I looked in my locker and\r\n"
"saw that my uniform was gone."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2928"
msgid ""
"Come on. The police probably took it as evidence. I'm sure\r\n"
"there was plenty of stuff missing from the crime scene."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2940"
msgid ""
"You're wrong! Someone was definitely harassing me.\r\n"
"Everyone teased me!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2952"
msgid "Asai-kun, why don't you tell them you took my uniform?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2964"
msgid "You took everything else. The uniform must've been you, too."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2976"
msgid "You're so whiny..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2988"
msgid ""
"Bully, police, whoever took it, it has nothing to do with\r\n"
"Akechi or this case."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3000"
msgid "No, Imagawa's uniform is the key to this case."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3012"
msgid "Huh? What do you mean?"
msgstr "Eh? Che vuoi dire?"

msgctxt "3024"
msgid "I'll show you right now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3036"
msgid ""
"(I can show them <Color:7>two pieces<Color:Default> of evidence that prove what\r\n"
"happened to Imagawa's uniform.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3060"
msgid "(And the other piece of evidence is...)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3084"
msgid "(And the other piece of evidence is...)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3108"
msgid ""
"Look at the List of Evidence I borrowed from you.\r\n"
"There's no waiter's uniform on it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3120"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3132"
msgid "Let's see... You're right. I don't see any waiter's uniform listed."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3144"
msgid ""
"In other words, the uniform disappeared before the police\r\n"
"showed up."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3156"
msgid "If the police didn't confiscate it, who could've taken it?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3168"
msgid "It was Asai-kun, right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3180"
msgid ""
"No, not Asai. He did steal things from you, true, but he\r\n"
"wasn't doing it to harass you. He was just after some cash."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3192"
msgid ""
"Your wallet and CDs make sense, but your uniform wouldn't\r\n"
"have been worth anything."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3204"
msgid "Well, then, who did it?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3216"
msgid "Oh! You mean the murderer took it!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3228"
msgid ""
"Exactly. The criminal wanted to make it look like somebody\r\n"
"else committed the crime, so they stole the waiter's uniform\r\n"
"and changed into it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3240"
msgid ""
"Then, as soon as somebody came by, they hid their face\r\n"
"and ran out the back exit."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3252"
msgid "Is that true?"
msgstr "Davvero?"

msgctxt "3276"
msgid "(No, that doesn't prove anything.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3288"
msgid ""
"(I need to show them <Color:7>two pieces<Color:Default> of evidence that prove what\r\n"
"happened to Imagawa's uniform.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3312"
msgid ""
"So you're saying the person who stole Imagawa's uniform and\r\n"
"fled the scene is the real criminal?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3324"
msgid "Yeah."
msgstr "Sì."

msgctxt "3336"
msgid "And who might that be?"
msgstr "E quale sarebbe?"

msgctxt "3444"
msgid "(The real criminal is...)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3468"
msgid "(Yes. This is the only person it could've been.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3492"
msgid "(No, that's not right. I should think a little harder.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3540"
msgid ""
"Well, I did as you asked, Detective. I closed the café and\r\n"
"kicked everyone out. Now, what's this all about?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3552"
msgid "Kiryu-san and his friend here would like to talk to all of you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3564"
msgid "I have you here for one reason, and one reason alone."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3576"
msgid ""
"I'm sure you all remember the murder that took place\r\n"
"here six years ago."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3588"
msgid ""
"The victim was Kazuo Oda-san, the manager of this café\r\n"
"at the time. One of the employees, Yuichi Akechi-san, was\r\n"
"arrested for his murder."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3600"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3612"
msgid "But did Akechi-san really kill Oda-san?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3624"
msgid "I'd like to ask each of you to think back on that day..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3636"
msgid ""
"Do any of you have any evidence⑬any truly conclusive\r\n"
"evidence⑬that Akechi-san was really the one who killed\r\n"
"Oda-san?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3648"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3660"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3672"
msgid ""
"I've been struggling with one question since the day of\r\n"
"that murder."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3684"
msgid "Could Akechi-san actually be innocent?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3696"
msgid ""
"But before I could find out for sure, an article I wrote\r\n"
"implicating Akechi-san as the murderer got published..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3708"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3720"
msgid ""
"But thanks to Kiryu-san here, we finally arrived at the\r\n"
"truth of what happened six years ago."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3732"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3744"
msgid ""
"But if Akechi-kun is innocent, that means someone else is\r\n"
"guilty..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3756"
msgid "Exactly."
msgstr "Esatto."

msgctxt "3768"
msgid "But..."
msgstr "Ma..."

msgctxt "3792"
msgid "What do you base all of this on, Kiryu-san?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3804"
msgid "(I need to show them proof of Yuichi Akechi's innocence.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3828"
msgid ""
"Usami was the one who saw Akechi and Oda fight the\r\n"
"day of the murder. Isn't that right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3840"
msgid "Yeah... But I left in the middle of it..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3852"
msgid ""
"In other words, she didn't actually see Akechi-san kill\r\n"
"Oda-san."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3864"
msgid "Exactly. And only Usami saw Oda and Akechi fighting."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3876"
msgid ""
"So we can't conclude Yuichi Akechi killed Oda, which means\r\n"
"the charges against him could be false."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3900"
msgid "(No, that doesn't prove anything.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3912"
msgid ""
"(I need to show why I believe Yuichi Akechi is innocent.\r\n"
"All I have to do is poke a hole in the charges against him.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3936"
msgid "Ha! Sorry, but that doesn't hold water."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3948"
msgid "What do you mean?"
msgstr "Cosa intendi?"

msgctxt "3960"
msgid ""
"Akechi's prints were on the weapon used to kill Oda.\r\n"
"That's solid evidence to prove Akechi did it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3972"
msgid "Is that all you have to say?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "3984"
msgid "Huh? What do you mean?"
msgstr "Eh? Che vuoi dire?"

msgctxt "3996"
msgid ""
"This was your case. You ought to know Akechi's fingerprints\r\n"
"on the murder weapon alone weren't enough to convict him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4008"
msgid "I don't follow you. Spell it out for us, will ya?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4020"
msgid "(There's evidence I should show them now.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4044"
msgid ""
"The ashtray used as the murder weapon hadn't been washed\r\n"
"because it was supposed to be thrown out."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4056"
msgid ""
"Akechi's prints weren't the only ones on it. That means\r\n"
"you can't prove his guilt from the fingerprints alone."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4068"
msgid "Detective, is that true?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4080"
msgid "Hmm... Yes, it's just as he says."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4092"
msgid "So you admit it might not have been my brother!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4104"
msgid "But that's still not enough to prove somebody else did it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4128"
msgid "(No, that doesn't prove anything.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4140"
msgid "(There's evidence I should show them now.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4164"
msgid ""
"Somebody witnessed Akechi fleeing the scene. That's\r\n"
"another piece of solid evidence."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4176"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4188"
msgid ""
"Think about it. You'd think the person actively fleeing\r\n"
"the scene of a crime is the culprit, wouldn't you? Why'd\r\n"
"they run away if they didn't do anything?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4200"
msgid "What do you have to say about that?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4212"
msgid ""
"Kiryu-san, do you have any information to refute the\r\n"
"witness statements about Akechi-san?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4224"
msgid "Let's see..."
msgstr "Vediamo..."

msgctxt "4236"
msgid ""
"(There was a hole in one of the witness statements.\r\n"
"I just need to argue that angle.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4260"
msgid "Kinoshita, you saw Akechi fleeing the scene, right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4272"
msgid "Yes, I did."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4284"
msgid "Are you sure?"
msgstr "Ne sei sicuro?"

msgctxt "4296"
msgid "I'm not lying! I'm sure I saw him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4308"
msgid ""
"But you didn't see the face of the person fleeing the scene.\r\n"
"You said that, right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4320"
msgid "Yeah... I only saw his back."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4332"
msgid "So then it's possible you saw somebody else."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4380"
msgid "(No, that doesn't prove anything.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "4392"
msgid ""
"(There was a hole in one of the witness statements.\r\n"
"I just need to argue that angle.)"
msgstr ""

